{"seq":2,"slug":"terraform-sentinel-conftest","title":"Terraform 与 Sentinel/Conftest","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms/terraform-sentinel-conftest","wordCount":1102,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"terraform-与-sentinel-conftest\">Terraform 与 Sentinel/Conftest</h1><p>基础设施即代码（IaC）将云资源定义转化为可版本控制的代码文件，而策略即代码则为这些 IaC 产出物加上合规检查的护栏。在 Terraform 生态中，HashiCorp Sentinel 和开源的 Conftest 是两大主流 PaC 工具。本章深入讲解如何在 IaC 工作流中集成策略检查，以及两种工具的使用方式和对比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h2 id=\"iac-策略检查的价值\">IaC 策略检查的价值</h2><p>在 Terraform plan 和 apply 之间插入策略检查，可以在资源实际创建之前发现安全隐患和合规问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Terraform 工作流&#10;        A[terraform init] --&gt; B[terraform plan]&#10;        B --&gt; C{策略检查}&#10;        C --&gt; |通过| D[terraform apply]&#10;        C --&gt; |失败| E[报告违规&lt;br/&gt;阻止部署]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Terraform 工作流\n        A[terraform init] --&gt; B[terraform plan]\n        B --&gt; C{策略检查}\n        C --&gt; |通过| D[terraform apply]\n        C --&gt; |失败| E[报告违规&lt;br/&gt;阻止部署]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查时机</th>\n<th>检查对象</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态 HCL 检查</td>\n<td><code>.tf</code> 文件</td>\n<td>快速，无需 plan</td>\n<td>无法解析动态值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plan JSON 检查</td>\n<td><code>terraform show -json</code> 输出</td>\n<td>包含解析后的实际值</td>\n<td>需要先运行 plan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apply 后检查</td>\n<td>已部署的云资源</td>\n<td>检查实际状态</td>\n<td>问题发现时资源已创建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>最佳实践：</strong> 生产环境建议同时使用静态检查（快速反馈）和 Plan JSON 检查（准确验证）。静态检查在开发阶段和 Pre-commit 钩子中运行，Plan JSON 检查在 CI 流水线中运行。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"conftest\">Conftest</h2><p>Conftest 是基于 OPA 的开源策略测试工具，支持对 Terraform、Kubernetes、Dockerfile 等多种配置格式进行策略检查。它是 OPA 生态中最流行的 IaC 策略工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h3><p>Conftest 封装了 OPA 引擎，提供了针对配置文件的便捷 CLI 接口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 输入&#10;        TF[Terraform Plan JSON]&#10;        K8S[Kubernetes YAML]&#10;        DF[Dockerfile]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Conftest&#10;        PARSER[格式解析器]&#10;        OPA[OPA 引擎]&#10;        POL[Rego 策略]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 输出&#10;        R1[通过/失败报告]&#10;        R2[SARIF 格式]&#10;        R3[JSON 输出]&#10;    end&#10;    TF &amp; K8S &amp; DF --&gt; PARSER&#10;    PARSER --&gt; OPA&#10;    POL --&gt; OPA&#10;    OPA --&gt; R1&#10;    OPA --&gt; R2&#10;    OPA --&gt; R3\">graph TD\n    subgraph 输入\n        TF[Terraform Plan JSON]\n        K8S[Kubernetes YAML]\n        DF[Dockerfile]\n    end\n    subgraph Conftest\n        PARSER[格式解析器]\n        OPA[OPA 引擎]\n        POL[Rego 策略]\n    end\n    subgraph 输出\n        R1[通过/失败报告]\n        R2[SARIF 格式]\n        R3[JSON 输出]\n    end\n    TF &amp; K8S &amp; DF --&gt; PARSER\n    PARSER --&gt; OPA\n    POL --&gt; OPA\n    OPA --&gt; R1\n    OPA --&gt; R2\n    OPA --&gt; R3</pre><h3 id=\"安装与基本使用\">安装与基本使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 Conftest&#10;brew install conftest&#10;# 或从 GitHub 下载&#10;wget https://github.com/open-policy-agent/conftest/releases/download/v0.50.0/conftest_0.50.0_Linux_x86_64.tar.gz&#10;&#10;# 检查 Terraform plan&#10;terraform plan -out=tfplan&#10;terraform show -json tfplan &gt; plan.json&#10;conftest test plan.json&#10;&#10;# 检查 Kubernetes YAML&#10;conftest test deployment.yaml&#10;&#10;# 检查多个文件&#10;conftest test k8s/*.yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 Conftest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> conftest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或从 GitHub 下载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wget</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/open-policy-agent/conftest/releases/download/v0.50.0/conftest_0.50.0_Linux_x86_64.tar.gz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查 Terraform plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">terraform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -out=tfplan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">terraform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tfplan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">conftest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查 Kubernetes YAML</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">conftest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查多个文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">conftest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> k8s/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"策略编写\">策略编写</h3><p>Conftest 策略使用 Rego 语言，默认放在 <code>policy/</code> 目录下。</p>\n<h4 id=\"terraform-plan-json-策略\">Terraform Plan JSON 策略</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"package main&#10;&#10;import future.keywords.if&#10;import future.keywords.in&#10;&#10;# 拒绝规则：S3 存储桶未启用服务器端加密&#10;deny[msg] if {&#10;  resource := input.resource_changes[_]&#10;  resource.type == &quot;aws_s3_bucket&quot;&#10;  resource.change.actions[_] != &quot;delete&quot;&#10;  not resource.change.after.server_side_encryption_configuration&#10;  msg := sprintf(&quot;S3 存储桶 %q 必须启用服务器端加密&quot;, [resource.address])&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 拒绝规则：安全组允许公网 SSH&#10;deny[msg] if {&#10;  resource := input.resource_changes[_]&#10;  resource.type == &quot;aws_security_group_rule&quot;&#10;  resource.change.after.type == &quot;ingress&quot;&#10;  resource.change.after.from_port == 22&#10;  resource.change.after.cidr_blocks[_] == &quot;0.0.0.0/0&quot;&#10;  msg := sprintf(&quot;安全组规则 %q 允许公网 SSH 访问&quot;, [resource.address])&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 警告规则：使用了超大规格实例&#10;warn[msg] if {&#10;  resource := input.resource_changes[_]&#10;  resource.type == &quot;aws_instance&quot;&#10;  instance_type := resource.change.after.instance_type&#10;  startswith(instance_type, &quot;m5.4xlarge&quot;)&#10;  msg := sprintf(&quot;实例 %q 使用了超大规格 %v，请确认是否必要&quot;, [resource.address, instance_type])&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>package main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import future.keywords.if</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import future.keywords.in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 拒绝规则：S3 存储桶未启用服务器端加密</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deny[msg] if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource := input.resource_changes[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource.type == \"aws_s3_bucket\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource.change.actions[_] != \"delete\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  not resource.change.after.server_side_encryption_configuration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  msg := sprintf(\"S3 存储桶 %q 必须启用服务器端加密\", [resource.address])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 拒绝规则：安全组允许公网 SSH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deny[msg] if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource := input.resource_changes[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource.type == \"aws_security_group_rule\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource.change.after.type == \"ingress\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource.change.after.from_port == 22</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource.change.after.cidr_blocks[_] == \"0.0.0.0/0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  msg := sprintf(\"安全组规则 %q 允许公网 SSH 访问\", [resource.address])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 警告规则：使用了超大规格实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>warn[msg] if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource := input.resource_changes[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource.type == \"aws_instance\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  instance_type := resource.change.after.instance_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  startswith(instance_type, \"m5.4xlarge\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  msg := sprintf(\"实例 %q 使用了超大规格 %v，请确认是否必要\", [resource.address, instance_type])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"标签策略\">标签策略</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"package main&#10;&#10;import future.keywords.if&#10;&#10;# 必须标签列表&#10;required_tags := [&quot;Environment&quot;, &quot;CostCenter&quot;, &quot;Owner&quot;]&#10;&#10;deny[msg] if {&#10;  resource := input.resource_changes[_]&#10;  resource.change.actions[_] != &quot;delete&quot;&#10;  tags := object.get(resource.change.after, &quot;tags&quot;, {})&#10;  missing := [t | t := required_tags[_]; not tags[t]]&#10;  count(missing) &gt; 0&#10;  msg := sprintf(&quot;资源 %q 缺少必需标签: %v&quot;, [resource.address, missing])&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>package main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import future.keywords.if</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 必须标签列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>required_tags := [\"Environment\", \"CostCenter\", \"Owner\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deny[msg] if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource := input.resource_changes[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resource.change.actions[_] != \"delete\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tags := object.get(resource.change.after, \"tags\", {})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  missing := [t | t := required_tags[_]; not tags[t]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count(missing) > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  msg := sprintf(\"资源 %q 缺少必需标签: %v\", [resource.address, missing])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"策略组织\">策略组织</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"policy/&#10;├── security/&#10;│   ├── s3_encryption.rego&#10;│   ├── security_group.rego&#10;│   └── iam_roles.rego&#10;├── cost/&#10;│   ├── instance_types.rego&#10;│   └── resource_tags.rego&#10;├── compliance/&#10;│   ├── data_residency.rego&#10;│   └── backup_policy.rego&#10;└── lib/&#10;    └── utils.rego\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>policy/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── security/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── s3_encryption.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── security_group.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── iam_roles.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── cost/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── instance_types.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── resource_tags.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── compliance/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── data_residency.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── backup_policy.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── lib/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── utils.rego</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 <code>--namespace</code> 指定要运行的策略集合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 只运行安全策略&#10;conftest test plan.json --namespace security&#10;&#10;# 运行所有策略&#10;conftest test plan.json --all-namespaces\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只运行安全策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">conftest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> security</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行所有策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">conftest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all-namespaces</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"hashicorp-sentinel\">HashiCorp Sentinel</h2><p>Sentinel 是 HashiCorp 官方的策略即代码框架，深度集成在 Terraform Cloud/Enterprise 中。</p>\n<h3 id=\"架构与集成\">架构与集成</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Terraform Cloud/Enterprise&#10;        PLAN[Plan 阶段] --&gt; SEN[Sentinel 策略检查]&#10;        SEN --&gt; |通过| COST[Cost Estimation]&#10;        COST --&gt; APPLY[Apply 阶段]&#10;        SEN --&gt; |失败| BLOCK[阻止 Apply]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Sentinel 策略&#10;        POL[.sentinel 策略文件]&#10;        IMP[import 通用模块]&#10;    end&#10;    POL --&gt; SEN&#10;    IMP --&gt; SEN\">graph TD\n    subgraph Terraform Cloud/Enterprise\n        PLAN[Plan 阶段] --&gt; SEN[Sentinel 策略检查]\n        SEN --&gt; |通过| COST[Cost Estimation]\n        COST --&gt; APPLY[Apply 阶段]\n        SEN --&gt; |失败| BLOCK[阻止 Apply]\n    end\n    subgraph Sentinel 策略\n        POL[.sentinel 策略文件]\n        IMP[import 通用模块]\n    end\n    POL --&gt; SEN\n    IMP --&gt; SEN</pre><p>Sentinel 的核心优势是与 Terraform Cloud/Enterprise 的深度集成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>直接访问 Plan、State 和 Provider 数据</li>\n<li>在 Cost Estimation 之前执行，可基于成本做策略决策</li>\n<li>支持策略集（Policy Set）的版本化管理</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"sentinel-策略示例\">Sentinel 策略示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 检查 S3 存储桶加密&#10;import &quot;tfplan/v2&quot; as tfplan&#10;&#10;s3_buckets = filter tfplan.resource_changes as _, rc {&#10;    rc.type is &quot;aws_s3_bucket&quot; and&#10;    (rc.change.actions contains &quot;create&quot; or rc.change.actions contains &quot;update&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;violations = filter s3_buckets as _, bucket {&#10;    bucket.change.after.server_side_encryption_configuration is null&#10;}&#10;&#10;main = rule {&#10;    length(violations) is 0&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查 S3 存储桶加密</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"tfplan/v2\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tfplan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s3_buckets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tfplan.resource_changes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, rc {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rc.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"aws_s3_bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (rc.change.actions contains </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"create\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rc.change.actions contains </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"update\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">violations </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s3_buckets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, bucket {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bucket.change.after.server_side_encryption_configuration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">main </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    length(violations) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 检查成本上限&#10;import &quot;tfrun&quot;&#10;&#10;cost_limit = 500  # 月成本上限（美元）&#10;&#10;main = rule {&#10;    tfrun.cost_estimate.monthly_cost &lt;= cost_limit&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查成本上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"tfrun\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cost_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 月成本上限（美元）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">main </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tfrun.cost_estimate.monthly_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost_limit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sentinel-执行模式\">Sentinel 执行模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>hard-mandatory</td>\n<td>失败则阻止 Apply</td>\n<td>安全红线策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>soft-mandatory</td>\n<td>失败但允许覆盖（需权限）</td>\n<td>重要但允许例外的策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>advisory</td>\n<td>仅显示警告</td>\n<td>最佳实践建议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"conftest-vs-sentinel-对比\">Conftest vs Sentinel 对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Conftest</th>\n<th>Sentinel</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>许可</td>\n<td>开源（Apache 2.0）</td>\n<td>需 Terraform Cloud/Team/Enterprise 订阅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略语言</td>\n<td>Rego</td>\n<td>Sentinel 专用语言（类 Python）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行环境</td>\n<td>任意 CI/CD、本地 CLI</td>\n<td>Terraform Cloud/Enterprise 内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支持格式</td>\n<td>Terraform、K8s、Dockerfile 等</td>\n<td>主要面向 Terraform（也支持 Vault、Consul）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本数据</td>\n<td>需自行集成</td>\n<td>内置 Cost Estimation 数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略测试</td>\n<td><code>conftest verify</code></td>\n<td><code>sentinel test</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区生态</td>\n<td>OPA 生态，策略库丰富</td>\n<td>HashiCorp 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多云支持</td>\n<td>与云厂商无关</td>\n<td>与 Terraform 深度绑定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q{选择决策}&#10;    Q --&gt; |使用 TFC/E 且需要成本策略| S[Sentinel]&#10;    Q --&gt; |开源优先/多格式检查| C[Conftest]&#10;    Q --&gt; |已有 OPA/Rego 经验| C&#10;    Q --&gt; |需要策略覆盖机制| S\">graph TD\n    Q{选择决策}\n    Q --&gt; |使用 TFC/E 且需要成本策略| S[Sentinel]\n    Q --&gt; |开源优先/多格式检查| C[Conftest]\n    Q --&gt; |已有 OPA/Rego 经验| C\n    Q --&gt; |需要策略覆盖机制| S</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ci-cd-集成实践\">CI/CD 集成实践</h2><p>将 Terraform 策略检查集成到 CI/CD 流水线中，实现自动化合规门禁。</p>\n<h3 id=\"github-actions-示例\">GitHub Actions 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Terraform Policy Check&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    paths:&#10;      - &#39;terraform/**&#39;&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  policy-check:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Setup Terraform&#10;        uses: hashicorp/setup-terraform@v3&#10;        with:&#10;          terraform_version: &#39;1.9.0&#39;&#10;&#10;      - name: Setup Conftest&#10;        uses: instrumenta/conftest-action/setup@master&#10;        with:&#10;          version: v0.50.0&#10;&#10;      - name: Terraform Init &amp; Plan&#10;        run: |&#10;          cd terraform&#10;          terraform init -backend=false&#10;          terraform plan -out=tfplan&#10;          terraform show -json tfplan &gt; plan.json&#10;&#10;      - name: Conftest Policy Check&#10;        uses: instrumenta/conftest-action@master&#10;        with:&#10;          file: terraform/plan.json&#10;          policy: policy/&#10;&#10;      - name: Static HCL Check&#10;        run: conftest test terraform/*.tf --parser hcl\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Terraform Policy Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'terraform/**'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policy-check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Setup Terraform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hashicorp/setup-terraform@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          terraform_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.9.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Setup Conftest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">instrumenta/conftest-action/setup@master</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v0.50.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Terraform Init &#x26; Plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          cd terraform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          terraform init -backend=false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          terraform plan -out=tfplan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          terraform show -json tfplan > plan.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Conftest Policy Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">instrumenta/conftest-action@master</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">terraform/plan.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">policy/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Static HCL Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">conftest test terraform/*.tf --parser hcl</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"pre-commit-钩子\">Pre-commit 钩子</h3><p>在本地开发阶段提供快速反馈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .pre-commit-config.yaml&#10;repos:&#10;  - repo: https://github.com/gruntwork-io/pre-commit&#10;    rev: v0.1.23&#10;    hooks:&#10;      - id: terraform-fmt&#10;      - id: terraform-validate&#10;  - repo: local&#10;    hooks:&#10;      - id: conftest&#10;        name: Conftest Policy Check&#10;        entry: conftest test --parser hcl&#10;        language: system&#10;        files: \\.tf$\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .pre-commit-config.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">repos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://github.com/gruntwork-io/pre-commit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v0.1.23</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hooks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">terraform-fmt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">terraform-validate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">local</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hooks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">conftest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Conftest Policy Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">conftest test --parser hcl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">system</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        files</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\.tf$</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"社区策略库\">社区策略库</h2><p>从零开始编写所有策略效率低下。以下社区资源提供了经过验证的策略模板：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>地址</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Conftest Policy Library</td>\n<td>官方维护的策略集合</td>\n<td>github.com/open-policy-agent/conftest/tree/master/examples</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS CIS 策略包</td>\n<td>AWS CIS 基准合规策略</td>\n<td>conftest.dev/policies/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rego Playground</td>\n<td>在线 Rego 编辑器和示例</td>\n<td>play.openpolicyagent.org</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kyverno Policies</td>\n<td>Kyverno 策略库（可作参考）</td>\n<td>kyverno.io/policies/</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong> 社区策略需要根据组织的具体要求进行调整和定制，不要直接用于生产环境。建议将社区策略作为起点，结合内部安全标准和合规要求进行裁剪和增强。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>IaC 策略检查是 CI/CD 流水线中策略门禁的重要组成部分。关于 CI/CD 中更广泛的策略集成模式，参见<a href=\"ci-cd-policy-gates\">CI/CD 策略门禁</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Terraform 策略检查))&#10;    检查时机&#10;      静态 HCL 检查&#10;      Plan JSON 检查&#10;      Apply 后检查&#10;    Conftest&#10;      基于 OPA/Rego&#10;      多格式支持&#10;      策略组织&#10;      CI/CD 集成&#10;    Sentinel&#10;      TFC/E 深度集成&#10;      成本感知策略&#10;      hard/soft/advisory&#10;    对比选型&#10;      开源 vs 商业&#10;      Rego vs Sentinel&#10;      多格式 vs 单平台&#10;    最佳实践&#10;      Pre-commit 快速反馈&#10;      CI 流水线门禁&#10;      社区策略作起点\">mindmap\n  root((Terraform 策略检查))\n    检查时机\n      静态 HCL 检查\n      Plan JSON 检查\n      Apply 后检查\n    Conftest\n      基于 OPA/Rego\n      多格式支持\n      策略组织\n      CI/CD 集成\n    Sentinel\n      TFC/E 深度集成\n      成本感知策略\n      hard/soft/advisory\n    对比选型\n      开源 vs 商业\n      Rego vs Sentinel\n      多格式 vs 单平台\n    最佳实践\n      Pre-commit 快速反馈\n      CI 流水线门禁\n      社区策略作起点</pre><ul>\n<li>IaC 策略检查的三个时机：静态 HCL 检查（快速）、Plan JSON 检查（准确）、Apply 后检查（兜底）。</li>\n<li>Conftest 基于 OPA/Rego，开源免费，支持 Terraform、K8s、Dockerfile 等多种格式，适合开源优先和多平台场景。</li>\n<li>Sentinel 与 Terraform Cloud/Enterprise 深度集成，支持成本感知策略和策略覆盖机制，适合重度使用 TFC/E 的团队。</li>\n<li>生产环境建议同时使用 Pre-commit 静态检查和 CI 流水线 Plan JSON 检查，形成分层防护。</li>\n<li>社区策略库是很好的起点，但需要根据组织标准定制后再用于生产。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Terraform 与 Sentinel/Conftest","id":"terraform-与-sentinel-conftest"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"IaC 策略检查的价值","id":"iac-策略检查的价值"},{"level":2,"text":"Conftest","id":"conftest"},{"level":3,"text":"工作原理","id":"工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"安装与基本使用","id":"安装与基本使用"},{"level":3,"text":"策略编写","id":"策略编写"},{"level":4,"text":"Terraform Plan JSON 策略","id":"terraform-plan-json-策略"},{"level":4,"text":"标签策略","id":"标签策略"},{"level":3,"text":"策略组织","id":"策略组织"},{"level":2,"text":"HashiCorp Sentinel","id":"hashicorp-sentinel"},{"level":3,"text":"架构与集成","id":"架构与集成"},{"level":3,"text":"Sentinel 策略示例","id":"sentinel-策略示例"},{"level":3,"text":"Sentinel 执行模式","id":"sentinel-执行模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Conftest vs Sentinel 对比","id":"conftest-vs-sentinel-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 集成实践","id":"ci-cd-集成实践"},{"level":3,"text":"GitHub Actions 示例","id":"github-actions-示例"},{"level":3,"text":"Pre-commit 钩子","id":"pre-commit-钩子"},{"level":2,"text":"社区策略库","id":"社区策略库"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Kubernetes 准入控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms/kubernetes-admission"},"next":{"title":"CI/CD 策略门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms/ci-cd-policy-gates"}}